      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's completely understandable that you're feeling lost and numb without him by your side. His absence can make you question your purpose and identity. Take time to grieve and allow yourself to feel your emotions, and don't hesitate to reach out for support from loved ones, friends, or a professional if needed. Remember that you are still you, and your life will evolve, but it may not be the same without his presence.",
      "source": "target",
